hange is issued, and the fresh instance is connected to the leader in both directions; the two peers of the committed configuration are restarted afterwards with RestoreCommittedLogs disabled. The change is the package's own AddVoter with prevIndex 0; no partition, no concurrent client change and no nonzero prevIndex case is exercised.\",\n   \"source_ids\": [\n    \"change_gate\",\n    \"append_config_change\",\n    \"next_configuration\",\n    \"commitment_set_config\",\n    \"cfg_entry\",\n    \"scan_start\",\n    \"restore_lastapplied\"\n   ],\n   \"executions\": {\n    \"2caa49e2796e4a19884ddafd38610f91\": [\n     43,\n     44,\n     45,\n     46\n    ]\n   },\n   \"changed_premise\": \"The earlier revision cited log index 110 for the configuration entry in the leader's own log. That index belongs to the five-voter discard case; the client-change receipt records its entry at log index 106, and an audit of every fact against its receipts found the other operands unchanged. The consequence and its conditions are unaffected.\",\n   \"affected_uses\": []\n  }\n ]\n}","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
